# suite po POAPPRV
ok 1 - PO-006 the order content is reduced to a hash
ok 2 - PO-006 the order value is read from the order
ok 3 - PO-006 the live line is counted
ok 4 - PO-006 the same content hashes the same way
ok 5 - PO-006 an unapproved order is not a commitment
ok 6 - PO-006 the check holds the order (06)
ok 7 - PO-006 and carries reason APV0011
ok 8 - PO-006 the request awaits a decision
ok 9 - PO-006 an approval request is recorded
ok 10 - D-07 the matrix names the required permission
ok 11 - PO-006 the order is now awaiting approval
ok 12 - D-07 a decision needs a named approver
ok 13 - D-07 and an explicit approve or reject
ok 14 - D-07 the preparer cannot approve their own order
ok 15 - D-07 self approval carries reason APV0007
ok 16 - D-07 the order is still awaiting approval
ok 17 - D-07 an independent approver can approve it
ok 18 - PO-006 an approved order returns 00
ok 19 - PO-006 the order status becomes APPROVED
ok 20 - PO-006 the check now answers APPROVED
ok 21 - PO-007 a note does not invalidate the approval
ok 22 - PO-007 and the content hash is unchanged
ok 23 - PO-007 a changed value needs approving again
ok 24 - PO-007 the check holds the order (06)
ok 25 - PO-007 and carries reason APV0006
ok 26 - PO-007 the old approval is marked invalidated
ok 27 - PO-007 the hash of the changed order differs
ok 28 - PO-007 re-requesting invalidates the old approval
ok 29 - PO-006 an order that does not exist is not found
ok 30 - PO-006 an unsupported function is refused
1..30
# po POAPPRV passed 00030 failed 00000
# exit 0
